# Task 1 evidence — harbor kitty adapter (2026-08-21)

## 0. Environment
- harbor 0.21.0 (uv tool), docker 29.7.2, ollama 0.32.14
- Host prereqs applied: OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0, OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH=16384 (systemd override), ufw allow 172.16.0.0/12 -> 11434
- Binary: bench/harbor/adapters/kitty/bin/kitty-cli built in ubuntu:22.04 (glibc 2.35) via build-binary.sh; host build rejected by jammy (GLIBC_2.39 not found — verified)
- NOTE: requested smoke task 'polyglot_python_hello-world' does not exist in the local aider-polyglot dataset (225 tasks); used 'polyglot_python_phone-number' instead.

