## 4. Observations
- ornith:9b: 5.15GiB fully in VRAM; agent ran 20 iterations / 229s; reward 0 (Write-on-existing blocked by Guard, needs Edit; model exhausted iterations)
- ornith-1.5:9b: 6.45GB weights, only 5.66GB in VRAM -> PARTIAL OFFLOAD (~0.8GB to CPU) as expected on 8GB RTX 2060 Super with 16k ctx KV cache; run took 958.8s; repeated thinking-budget overruns (6k tokens vs 1024 budget); reward 0
- tok/s (direct API, short gen): ornith:9b 53.7 tok/s; ornith-1.5:9b 53.6 tok/s gen but prompt processing 213 tok/s vs 560 tok/s (offload penalty)
- kitty-env.txt per trial confirms model/profile/ollama_url parameterization (see jobs/<ts>/.../agent/kitty-env.txt)
